{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":42676,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793471514719,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2001,"episodeCount":26,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vTnhIdSrSyrUfWTGCYMUFdfXXKV.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"882125","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A Native Alter named Kazuma uses a plane to attack kidnappers and finish a job. Now the police organizations named Hold and Holy are after him, thinking he's a dangerous criminal just because he's a Native Alter. But, Kazuma proves that he's not bad when he takes on a renegade group leader, Biff, and saves the Native Alters. Kazuma just seems to have a grudge against Holy.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-07-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g8ecKFg9ShSpboMpWurPFXlCrp1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g8ecKFg9ShSpboMpWurPFXlCrp1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"882124","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The organization of Holy is explained more clearly as is how Ryuho and Mimori first met. Both Ryuho and Mimori gain a bigger interest in the Native Alter, Kazuma.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-07-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kUrYzVMryhCqP2iW0bH2KjbFcJB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kUrYzVMryhCqP2iW0bH2KjbFcJB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"882123","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After being captured by Holy, Kazuma is imprisoned and offered two choices; join HOLY or be imprisoned. When a sympathetic Mimori sets Kazuma free, he must find a way to escape the confines of HOLY Headquarters.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-07-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qo6kaIN0ZHp3sS6sGsRv7DD8oK3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qo6kaIN0ZHp3sS6sGsRv7DD8oK3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"882122","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After hearing about Kazuma's escape from Holy, a new client, Ayase Terada, hires Kazuma and Kimishima to rescue her sick brother and the villagers from a Hold camp.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-07-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8H2Vb914AYwWwawNaZEvI5XMY9j.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8H2Vb914AYwWwawNaZEvI5XMY9j.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"882129","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After returning from a mission, Kazuma and Kimishima find Kanami lying on the floor sick. Without the proper medical knowledge, Kazuma and Kimishima are forced to find a doctor of Holy.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-08-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/d4r7sQqhINljtfqlyHIkvEC8FkL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d4r7sQqhINljtfqlyHIkvEC8FkL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"882128","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With much resentment toward Hold and Holy, some Native Alters, including Kazuma and Kimishima, plan an attack on a Holy cargo van. Knowing this, Holy plats a trap.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-08-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AGE8AoLTQKjjLqspdIgtVduqZ5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AGE8AoLTQKjjLqspdIgtVduqZ5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"882127","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Trapped underground, Kazuma and Tachibana call a temporary truce in order to find a way out. When they do a find a way out, a giant monster appears. Kazuma instantly resorts to attacking it, which Tachibana disapproves of.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-08-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/40ZCKAWWEcyLAiUe7FNLPadHeKQ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/40ZCKAWWEcyLAiUe7FNLPadHeKQ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"882126","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After being told that he must re-enter Holy to rescue the others, Kazuma charges right though the front door. Unfortunately, a Holy member, Unkei uses his alter, the Mad Sprict, to control Kazuma and the events that surround him.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-08-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n5bdX7tdLshFah5Yf9ZBh3h60wv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n5bdX7tdLshFah5Yf9ZBh3h60wv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"882141","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Wanting to stop Holy once and for all, Kazuma ventures into the Alter forest in hopes of gaining more power.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-08-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xDWtc9CIpbryjjn6wFwuo5HwKE7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xDWtc9CIpbryjjn6wFwuo5HwKE7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"882140","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kazuma and Kimishima come to a town of inners that love Holy due to a man named Emergy Maxfell. Not falling for his trap, Kazuma and Kimishima beat Emergy up and force him to show his true colors. Unfortunately, Emergy's alter only appears when he's in a pinch, and due to Kazuma beating him up, that's exactly what he's in.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-09-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yaSuNCEBguabeXgp77OZNd7FeQW.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yaSuNCEBguabeXgp77OZNd7FeQW.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"882136","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After revealing that she knows the truth about the alters and Holy to Commander Sigmar, Mimori is thrown in a cell. There, she recollects the events of the past 10 episodes of the series. She also explains the events of the terrible earthquake, and the birth of the Lost Ground so many years ago.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-09-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hD41sOrSaYG6DE2tnCxgbTllEfc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hD41sOrSaYG6DE2tnCxgbTllEfc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"882137","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Hold is still deciding what to do with the town it captured from the previous episode's ending. Kimishima goes home and finds Kanami, who wasn't taken after all! He tells her to make a run for it, but before they even get out of the house, Hold intercepts them and drags them off to the camp with the rest of the towns people. In the camp Kazuma is accused of beeing responsible for the destruction. Kimishima defends his friend in front of the townspeople and flees the scene, together with Kanami.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-09-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8BdYRhBTtEXNZLpZbG02S2s3e0B.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8BdYRhBTtEXNZLpZbG02S2s3e0B.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"882138","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Wanting revenge for the death of his friend, Kazuma attacks a Hold camp. Hearing the news, Ryuho sets out to find him. The two eventually meet and fight it out. Mimori and Tachibana manage to catch up to them, as do Urizane and Sherrice.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-09-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/li1ZYuf2fQubeZN6XpcZHpjnbCf.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/li1ZYuf2fQubeZN6XpcZHpjnbCf.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"882139","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Eight months after the fight and disappearance of Kazima and Ryuho, Mimori, Tachibana, and Cougar search the Lost Ground, seeking answers and the whereabouts of their friends. Elsewhere, Kanami is captured and forced to work at a labor camp.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-10-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cpcqk5Fp6MxQWU0r9PGQprnBC5u.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cpcqk5Fp6MxQWU0r9PGQprnBC5u.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"882132","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Not remembering anything, Kazuma is forced to fight in an Alter fighting arena. Mimori and Tachibana show up and try to get Kazuma to remember, but to no avail. Will Kazuma ever remember? And if he does what part of his past will allow him to? Elsewhere, Kanami and Ryuho get closer.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-10-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g9oKJvYA8ArRWvVQ3yw5Noaongs.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g9oKJvYA8ArRWvVQ3yw5Noaongs.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"882133","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"So Kigetsuki and Unkei, along with the Tokonatsu Three Sisters, devise a plain against Ryuho. They want to see how powerful he's gotten since he saw the \"other side\".","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-10-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mKmx8210BVp7d0XHFbIBt1SoXy5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mKmx8210BVp7d0XHFbIBt1SoXy5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"882134","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Ayase and Kazuma are forced to fight one another. Ayase explains that after being captured by Holy they experimented on her and made her alter more powerful. Now, if she wants her dying brother to get better, she has to kill Kazuma.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-10-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ApNKDjwhmY4mL9MOo9MEDVIrKiU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ApNKDjwhmY4mL9MOo9MEDVIrKiU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"882135","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Wanting to find Kazuma, Kanami sets off. Ryuho goes with her to protect her, while Sherrice stays behind and looks over the village. Meanwhile, Cougar informs Mimori and Tachibana that he knows where Ryuho is. The two set off to find him, but instead come across Biff.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-10-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ve10Mn2eJH0NiygWo2KK91EvDla.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ve10Mn2eJH0NiygWo2KK91EvDla.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"882130","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sherrice gets attacked by the darths led by Kigetsuki and his alter, Tokonatsu Three Sisters. Just when it looks grim for Sherrice, Ryuho and the others show up. But, can Ryuho fight back knowing that the villagers' lives are in danger? And will Kigetsuki get Ryuho to open up an alter gate? Meanwhile, Cougar and Kazuma are heading to the scene.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-11-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qCf8qZ5BLUSsNjdzGbP4h4t2NxP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qCf8qZ5BLUSsNjdzGbP4h4t2NxP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"882131","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After being reunited after so long, Kazuma and Kanami reminisce about the past. Elsewhere, Ryuho, Tachibana, Sherrice, Mimori, and Cougar all discuss their next plan of action.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-11-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wjtxVPHpLUBzBHyyqENdImVgVwm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wjtxVPHpLUBzBHyyqENdImVgVwm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"882117","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Episodio 21","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After Kyouji Mujo takes Kanami hostage, both Kazuma and Ryuho decide to head out alone and rescue her. Cougar stops them, telling them that they must work together and go with everyone else as a group. Meanwhile, Mujo is still bent on getting Kazuma and Ryuho to open up the other dimension.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-11-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mulUIsBhQyiL3OGcANKQpfBVXbx.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mulUIsBhQyiL3OGcANKQpfBVXbx.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"882116","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kazuma and Ryuho break into Kyouji Mujo's fortress. They split up for the time being and each meet up with a former ally.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-11-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uUoxhBicSG8N3hfxH5FhZxptXBs.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uUoxhBicSG8N3hfxH5FhZxptXBs.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"882119","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mimori and Cougar come across Kyouji Mujo. Cougar tells Mimori to go on ahead and find the main power generator so that she can weaken Mujo. But, can Cougar win against the newly powerful Mujo? Elsewhere, Kazuma is having some problems of his own when his right hand looses all feeling. Can he continue fighting? Meanwhile, Ryuho finally comes across the Crystallized Form.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-12-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4ak3OnpDGeNxsJreQY37S8rmw5p.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4ak3OnpDGeNxsJreQY37S8rmw5p.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/23"},{"id":"882118","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Episodio 24","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kazuma and Ryuho finally come across Kyouji Mujo. Kazuma takes him on while Ryuho fights the Crystallized Form.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-12-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qW4Aq0bSc0zxMQylZsFBh6a3It9.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qW4Aq0bSc0zxMQylZsFBh6a3It9.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/24"},{"id":"882121","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":25,"title":{"value":"Episodio 25","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After Mujo's defeat, the Mainland steps in to clean everything up. But, this is bad news for Kazuma and Ryuho, as the Mainland isn't done with them yet. Kazuma and Ryuho says their goodbyes to their loved ones and set out to fight the Mainland.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-12-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a8Csrcn0zUU1OBUfhgNgMaMq1EF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a8Csrcn0zUU1OBUfhgNgMaMq1EF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/25"},{"id":"882120","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":26,"title":{"value":"Episodio 26","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With the Lost Ground and Inners rebuilding, Kazuma and Ryuho can finally fight, free of distractions.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-12-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8opwptEZvBKUyGsWw2uhWYWy8HR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8opwptEZvBKUyGsWw2uhWYWy8HR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1/episode/26"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42676/season/1"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793471514719,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793471514719,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793471514719,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793471514719,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793471514719,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793471514719,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793471514719,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793471514719,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"9":{"checkedAt":1793471514719,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"10":{"checkedAt":1793471514719,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"11":{"checkedAt":1793471514719,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"12":{"ch